c16542dd5)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T00:00:00.0000000\\n\\n [What this does highlight is the disconnect between companies like Google and OpenClaw users. OpenClaw offered many interesting possibilities for creating workflows with agents.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fventurebeat.com%2Forchestration%2Fgoogle%2Dclamps%2Ddown%2Don%2Dantigravity%2Dmalicious%2Dusage%2Dcutting%2Doff%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers&rut=49e7c6a497282f19c3679c9936a8b62090d5e6e3a7f5d85e3e074e6c16542dd5)\\n\\n## [Google bans Antigravity users over OpenClaw access, cites surge in ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d\\n\\n [indianexpress.com/article/technology/artificial-intelligence/google-bans-antigravity-users-openclaw-10547187/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T07:53:00.0000000\\n\\n [Google restricted the accounts of several users, including Antigravity and Gemini AI Ultra subscribers, who accessed its Gemini AI models through open-source AI agent OpenClaw, the search giant has partially confirmed. Varun Mohan, former Windsurf CEO and Google Deepmind engineer, said that the ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\\n\\n## [Google Antigravity falls to Earth under compute burden](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35\\n\\n [www.theregister.com/2026/02/23/google_antigravity_compute_burden/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T20:49:00.0000000\\n\\n [Google customers paying $250 per month for AI Ultra subscriptions and less extravagant spenders have been surprised to find their accounts suspended for using the company's Antigravity agent development app and Gemini services with third-party agent tools like OpenClaw and OpenCode. Over the past ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\\n\\n## [Google Antigravity falls to Earth under OpenClaw-fueled compute load - MSN](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Fnews%2Ftechnology%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dfalls%2Dto%2Dearth%2Dunder%2Dopenclaw%2Dfueled%2Dcompute%2Dload%2Far%2DAA1WVdoH&rut=4b5524fc9b8614d5912e7d3225271285e2b5e7df7940513047ee10be0220f19f)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Fnews%2Ftechnology%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dfalls%2Dto%2Dearth%2Dunder%2Dopenclaw%2Dfueled%2Dcompute%2Dload%2Far%2DAA1WVdoH&rut=4b5524fc9b8614d5912e7d3225271285e2b5e7df7940513047ee10be0220f19f\\n\\n [www.msn.com/en-us/news/technology/google-antigravity-falls-to-earth-under-openclaw-fueled-compute-load/ar-AA1WVdoH](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Fnews%2Ftechnology%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dfalls%2Dto%2Dearth%2Dunder%2Dopenclaw%2Dfueled%2Dcompute%2Dload%2Far%2DAA1WVdoH&rut=4b5524fc9b8614d5912e7d3225271285e2b5e7df7940513047ee10be0220f19f)\\n\\n [Dissatisfied customers have expressed skepticism that using Antigravity and Gemini CLI with a third-party wrapper or harness like OpenClaw can legitimately be characterized as malicious.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Fnews%2Ftechnology%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dfalls%2Dto%2Dearth%2Dunder%2Dopenclaw%2Dfueled%2Dcompute%2Dload%2Far%2DAA1WVdoH&rut=4b5524fc9b8614d5912e7d3225271285e2b5e7df7940513047ee10be0220f19f)\\n\\n## [Google Bans OpenClaw Users Over OAuth Token Abuse](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.secure.com%2Fblog%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Da%2Dwarning%2Dshot%2Dfor%2Dthe%2Dagentic%2Dai%2Dera&rut=4bc40dbb1287659991397a5e4d30c80fe2913ca2b0ecf1c78dd8f51dd18fafbe)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.secure.com%2Fblog%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Da%2Dwarning%2Dshot%2Dfor%2Dthe%2Dagentic%2Dai%2Dera&rut=4bc40dbb1287659991397a5e4d30c80fe2913ca2b0ecf1c78dd8f51dd18fafbe\\n\\n [www.secure.com/blog/google-bans-openclaw-users-a-warning-shot-for-the-agentic-ai-era](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.secure.com%2Fblog%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Da%2Dwarning%2Dshot%2Dfor%2Dthe%2Dagentic%2Dai%2Dera&rut=4bc40dbb1287659991397a5e4d30c80fe2913ca2b0ecf1c78dd8f51dd18fafbe)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T00:00:00.0000000\\n\\n [What Happened? OpenClaw launched in November 2025 and quickly became a hit in the developer community — 219,000 GitHub stars in just a few months. The tool lets users run local AI agents for tasks like email management and web browsing. To make it work, many users authenticated through Google Antigravity, Google DeepMind's developer-facing Gemini platform, using an OAuth plugin that routed ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.secure.com%2Fblog%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Da%2Dwarning%2Dshot%2Dfor%2Dthe%2Dagentic%2Dai%2Dera&rut=4bc40dbb1287659991397a5e4d30c80fe2913ca2b0ecf1c78dd8f51dd18fafbe)\\n\\n## [What's behind the OpenClaw ban wave - PCWorld](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcworld.com%2Farticle%2F3068842%2Fwhats%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave.html&rut=caa2c9ead04f66c3ef8ee255946ea2e2184fca114379355e7ccd5577eb115ba7)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcworld.com%2Farticle%2F3068842%2Fwhats%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave.html&rut=caa2c9ead04f66c3ef8ee255946ea2e2184fca114379355e7ccd5577eb115ba7\\n\\n [www.pcworld.com/article/3068842/whats-behind-the-openclaw-ban-wave.html](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcworld.com%2Farticle%2F3068842%2Fwhats%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave.html&rut=caa2c9ead04f66c3ef8ee255946ea2e2184fca114379355e7ccd5577eb115ba7)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T21:06:00.0000000\\n\\n [PCWorld reports that Anthropic and Google are banning users who connect flat-rate Claude or Gemini accounts to OpenClaw due to excessive AI token consumption. Google DeepMind cites \\\"malicious ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.pcworld.com%2Farticle%2F3068842%2Fwhats%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave.html&rut=caa2c9ead04f66c3ef8ee255946ea2e2184fca114379355e7ccd5577eb115ba7)\\n\\n## [Google restricts Antigravity users tied to suspicious OpenClaw ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d\\n\\n [www.businesstoday.in/technology/news/story/google-restricts-antigravity-users-tied-to-suspicious-openclaw-behaviour-517570-2026-02-23](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\\n\\n     2026-02-23T10:20:00.0000000\\n\\n [In response to the ban, OpenClaw's Peter Steinberger has publicly criticised the decision online, calling it a \\\"draconian\\\" move. In X post, he said, \\\"Pretty draconian from Google.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\\n\\n## [Google Antigravity Bans OpenClaw Users Citing Malicious Usage](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a)\\n\\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a\\n\\n [theoutpost.ai/news-story/google-antigravity-blocks-open-claw-users-as-compute-burden-triggers-account-bans-24033/](//duckduc\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b0f953189cd45b84\\\">>>\"\n}"}],"details":{"url":"https://duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Google%20DeepMind%20OpenClaw%20Antigravity%20ban%20appeal","finalUrl":"https://html.duckduckgo.com/html/?q=Google%20DeepMind%20OpenClaw%20Antigravity%20ban%20appeal","status":200,"contentType":"text/html","title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"bb761f9532392d7d\">>>\nSource: Web Fetch