 \\\"username\\\": \\\"Abhijit_Pramanik\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Abhijit Pramanik\\\",\\n          \\\"avatar_template\\\": \\\"/user_avatar/discuss.ai.google.dev/abhijit_pramanik/{size}/32083_2.png\\\"\\n        },\\n        \\\"bookmarked\\\": false,\\n        \\\"actions_summary\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": 2,\\n            \\\"count\\\": 3\\n          }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"moderator\\\": false,\\n        \\\"admin\\\": false,\\n        \\\"staff\\\": false,\\n        \\\"user_id\\\": 98443,\\n        \\\"hidden\\\": false,\\n        \\\"trust_level\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"deleted_at\\\": null,\\n        \\\"user_deleted\\\": false,\\n        \\\"edit_reason\\\": null,\\n        \\\"can_view_edit_history\\\": true,\\n        \\\"wiki\\\": false,\\n        \\\"post_url\\\": \\\"/t/account-restricted-without-warning-google-ai-ultra-oauth-via-openclaw/122778/3\\\",\\n        \\\"reactions\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": \\\"heart\\\",\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"emoji\\\",\\n            \\\"count\\\": 3\\n          }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"current_user_reaction\\\": null,\\n        \\\"reaction_users_count\\\": 3,\\n        \\\"current_user_used_main_reaction\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_accept_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_unaccept_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"accepted_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"topic_accepted_answer\\\": null\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"id\\\": 231195,\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Aminreza Khoshbahar\\\",\\n        \\\"username\\\": \\\"Aminreza_Khoshbahar\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_template\\\": \\\"/user_avatar/discuss.ai.google.dev/aminreza_khoshbahar/{size}/92600_2.png\\\",\\n        \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-02-13T20:28:28.039Z\\\",\\n        \\\"cooked\\\": \\\"<p><strong>[UPDATE]</strong> Day 4, and still total silence from support. I’ve received zero acknowledgement through official channels or the feedback center. I am now in the process of moving all my data and subscriptions off Google. It’s staggering that an organization of this scale can be this unresponsive to a widespread issue.</p>\\\\n<p>Truly a <strong>SHAMEFUL</strong> standard of customer care.</p>\\\",\\n        \\\"post_number\\\": 4,\\n        \\\"post_type\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"posts_count\\\": 37,\\n        \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-02-13T20:28:28.039Z\\\",\\n        \\\"reply_count\\\": 2,\\n        \\\"reply_to_post_number\\\": 2,\\n        \\\"quote_count\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"incoming_link_count\\\": 87,\\n        \\\"reads\\\": 212,\\n        \\\"readers_count\\\": 211,\\n        \\\"score\\\": 592.2,\\n        \\\"yours\\\": false,\\n        \\\"topic_id\\\": 122778,\\n        \\\"topic_slug\\\": \\\"account-restricted-without-warning-google-ai-ultra-oauth-via-openclaw\\\",\\n        \\\"display_username\\\": \\\"Aminreza Khoshbahar\\\",\\n        \\\"primary_group_name\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_name\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_url\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_bg_color\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_color\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_group_id\\\": null,\\n        \\\"badges_granted\\\": [],\\n        \\\"version\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"can_edit\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_delete\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_recover\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_see_hidden_post\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_wiki\\\": false,\\n        \\\"read\\\": true,\\n        \\\"user_title\\\": null,\\n        \\\"reply_to_user\\\": {\\n          \\\"id\\\": 79823,\\n          \\\"username\\\": \\\"Abhijit_Pramanik\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Abhijit Pramanik\\\",\\n          \\\"avatar_template\\\": \\\"/user_avatar/discuss.ai.google.dev/abhijit_pramanik/{size}/32083_2.png\\\"\\n        },\\n        \\\"bookmarked\\\": false,\\n        \\\"actions_summary\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": 2,\\n            \\\"count\\\": 7\\n          }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"moderator\\\": false,\\n        \\\"admin\\\": false,\\n        \\\"staff\\\": false,\\n        \\\"user_id\\\": 98443,\\n        \\\"hidden\\\": false,\\n        \\\"trust_level\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"deleted_at\\\": null,\\n        \\\"user_deleted\\\": false,\\n        \\\"edit_reason\\\": null,\\n        \\\"can_view_edit_history\\\": true,\\n        \\\"wiki\\\": false,\\n        \\\"post_url\\\": \\\"/t/account-restricted-without-warning-google-ai-ultra-oauth-via-openclaw/122778/4\\\",\\n        \\\"reactions\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": \\\"heart\\\",\\n            \\\"type\\\": \\\"emoji\\\",\\n            \\\"count\\\": 7\\n          }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"current_user_reaction\\\": null,\\n        \\\"reaction_users_count\\\": 7,\\n        \\\"current_user_used_main_reaction\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_accept_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_unaccept_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"accepted_answer\\\": false,\\n        \\\"topic_accepted_answer\\\": null\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\\"id\\\": 231224,\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Mike L\\\",\\n        \\\"username\\\": \\\"Mike_L\\\",\\n        \\\"avatar_template\\\": \\\"/user_avatar/discuss.ai.google.dev/mike_l/{size}/34632_2.png\\\",\\n        \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-02-13T22:01:52.763Z\\\",\\n        \\\"cooked\\\": \\\"<p>I contacted the Google Cloud Support via “GCP Account Suspension Inquiry”. They told me to contact Google One Support, because the error is tied to the personal subscription, not to a “Google Cloud project billing account”.  Google One support told me to contact Google Cloud support <img src=\\\\\\\"https://d1dlmcr85iqnpo.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/joy.png?v=15\\\\\\\" title=\\\\\\\":joy:\\\\\\\" class=\\\\\\\"emoji\\\\\\\" alt=\\\\\\\":joy:\\\\\\\" loading=\\\\\\\"lazy\\\\\\\" width=\\\\\\\"20\\\\\\\" height=\\\\\\\"20\\\\\\\"></p>\\\\n<p>From emails “gemini-code-assist-user-feedback” or “antigravity-support” still no answer.<br>\\\\nAnd it happens after some days after I bought the subscription for an year…</p>\\\",\\n        \\\"post_number\\\": 5,\\n        \\\"post_type\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"posts_count\\\": 37,\\n        \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-02-13T22:01:52.763Z\\\",\\n        \\\"reply_count\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"reply_to_post_number\\\": null,\\n        \\\"quote_count\\\": 0,\\n        \\\"incoming_link_count\\\": 38,\\n        \\\"reads\\\": 202,\\n        \\\"readers_count\\\": 201,\\n        \\\"score\\\": 260.2,\\n        \\\"yours\\\": false,\\n        \\\"topic_id\\\": 122778,\\n        \\\"topic_slug\\\": \\\"account-restricted-without-warning-google-ai-ultra-oauth-via-openclaw\\\",\\n        \\\"display_username\\\": \\\"Mike L\\\",\\n        \\\"primary_group_name\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_name\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_url\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_bg_color\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_color\\\": null,\\n        \\\"flair_group_id\\\": null,\\n        \\\"badges_granted\\\": [],\\n        \\\"version\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"can_edit\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_delete\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_recover\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_see_hidden_post\\\": false,\\n        \\\"can_wiki\\\": false,\\n        \\\"read\\\": true,\\n        \\\"user_title\\\": null,\\n        \\\"bookmarked\\\": false,\\n        \\\"actions_summary\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": 2,\\n            \\\"count\\\": 2\\n          }\\n        ],\\n        \\\"moderator\\\": false,\\n        \\\"admin\\\": false,\\n        \\\"staff\\\": false,\\n        \\\"user_id\\\": 97978,\\n        \\\"hidden\\\": false,\\n        \\\"trust_level\\\": 1,\\n        \\\"deleted_at\\\": null,\\n        \\\"user_deleted\\\": false,\\n        \\\"edit_reason\\\": null,\\n        \\\"can_view_edit_history\\\": true,\\n        \\\"wiki\\\": false,\\n        \\\"post_url\\\": \\\"/t/account-restricted-without-warning-google-ai-ultra-oauth-via-openclaw/122778/5\\\",\\n        \\\"reactions\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"id\\\": \\\"heart\\\",\\n            \\