n)\n\n Turkey\n\n US (English)\n\n US (Spanish)\n\n Ukraine\n\n United Kingdom\n\n Vietnam (en)\n\n Any Time\n\n Past Day\n\n Past Week\n\n Past Month\n\n Past Year\n\n## [Google bans Antigravity users over OpenClaw access, cites surge in ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d\n\n [indianexpress.com/article/technology/artificial-intelligence/google-bans-antigravity-users-openclaw-10547187/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\n\n     2026-02-23T07:53:00.0000000\n\n [\"We needed to find a path to quickly shut off access to these users that are not using the product as intended,\" Mohan said. \"We understand that a subset of these users were not aware that this was against our ToS and will get a path for them to come back on but we have limited capacity and want to be fair to our actual users,\" he added.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Findianexpress.com%2Farticle%2Ftechnology%2Fartificial%2Dintelligence%2Fgoogle%2Dbans%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dopenclaw%2D10547187%2F&rut=a39d5df3f19d72a6e051278339023705a891938cd9af90eb0c35093c51c5837d)\n\n## [Google Antigravity falls to Earth under compute burden](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35\n\n [www.theregister.com/2026/02/23/google_antigravity_compute_burden/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\n\n     2026-02-23T20:49:00.0000000\n\n [Varun Mohan, co-founder of Windsurf and now a DeepMind engineer, said that the account bans followed from malicious usage, though customers argue that that's a mischaracterization of what they were doing.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theregister.com%2F2026%2F02%2F23%2Fgoogle_antigravity_compute_burden%2F&rut=1d8a10c7a06fd0b84446d0f1fb6b288a51a2a182c78a19b876c677c669eeed35)\n\n## [After Anthropic, Google's Antigravity Restricts Access to OpenClaw](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fofficechai.com%2Fai%2Fafter%2Danthropic%2Dgoogles%2Dantigravity%2Drestricts%2Daccess%2Dto%2Dopenclaw%2F&rut=59854870dee8654e5e0f8745d2eae013ea409b885b09d29bedf9b30afaac4c99)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fofficechai.com%2Fai%2Fafter%2Danthropic%2Dgoogles%2Dantigravity%2Drestricts%2Daccess%2Dto%2Dopenclaw%2F&rut=59854870dee8654e5e0f8745d2eae013ea409b885b09d29bedf9b30afaac4c99\n\n [officechai.com/ai/after-anthropic-googles-antigravity-restricts-access-to-openclaw/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fofficechai.com%2Fai%2Fafter%2Danthropic%2Dgoogles%2Dantigravity%2Drestricts%2Daccess%2Dto%2Dopenclaw%2F&rut=59854870dee8654e5e0f8745d2eae013ea409b885b09d29bedf9b30afaac4c99)\n\n     2026-02-23T13:34:12.0000000\n\n [Mohan was careful to clarify that only Antigravity access has been affected, leaving other Google and Google AI services untouched, and promised a path back for users who violated terms unknowingly. Still, the speed and breadth of the ban left many developers frustrated.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fofficechai.com%2Fai%2Fafter%2Danthropic%2Dgoogles%2Dantigravity%2Drestricts%2Daccess%2Dto%2Dopenclaw%2F&rut=59854870dee8654e5e0f8745d2eae013ea409b885b09d29bedf9b30afaac4c99)\n\n## [Google Antigravity Bans OpenClaw Users Citing Malicious Usage](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a\n\n [theoutpost.ai/news-story/google-antigravity-blocks-open-claw-users-as-compute-burden-triggers-account-bans-24033/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a)\n\n     2026-02-23T00:00:00.0000000\n\n [Responding to the hubbub on X, Google DeepMind engineer Varun Mohan said the company has \"been seeing a massive increase in malicious usage of the Anitgravity backend that has tremendously degraded the quality of service for our users. We needed to find a path to quickly shut off access to these users that are not using the product as intended.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Ftheoutpost.ai%2Fnews%2Dstory%2Fgoogle%2Dantigravity%2Dblocks%2Dopen%2Dclaw%2Dusers%2Das%2Dcompute%2Dburden%2Dtriggers%2Daccount%2Dbans%2D24033%2F&rut=a9cc13d11eaaee16f98de7781a60ea08ec5c36b6b237223aa1b559d830304c6a)\n\n## [What's behind the OpenClaw ban wave - MSN](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Ftechnology%2Fgeneral%2Fwhat%2Ds%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave%2Far%2DAA1WVnuA&rut=3dfa14bec434efd93a2a96120045fb416351dae873f55efbea6597295b6e4682)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Ftechnology%2Fgeneral%2Fwhat%2Ds%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave%2Far%2DAA1WVnuA&rut=3dfa14bec434efd93a2a96120045fb416351dae873f55efbea6597295b6e4682\n\n [www.msn.com/en-us/technology/general/what-s-behind-the-openclaw-ban-wave/ar-AA1WVnuA](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Ftechnology%2Fgeneral%2Fwhat%2Ds%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave%2Far%2DAA1WVnuA&rut=3dfa14bec434efd93a2a96120045fb416351dae873f55efbea6597295b6e4682)\n\n [And to the point of Google DeepMind's Varun Mohan, the OpenClaw-driven surge in OAuth usage may have taken a toll on non-OpenClaw users on the same flat-rate plans.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.msn.com%2Fen%2Dus%2Ftechnology%2Fgeneral%2Fwhat%2Ds%2Dbehind%2Dthe%2Dopenclaw%2Dban%2Dwave%2Far%2DAA1WVnuA&rut=3dfa14bec434efd93a2a96120045fb416351dae873f55efbea6597295b6e4682)\n\n## [Google restricts Antigravity users tied to suspicious OpenClaw ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d\n\n [www.businesstoday.in/technology/news/story/google-restricts-antigravity-users-tied-to-suspicious-openclaw-behaviour-517570-2026-02-23](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\n\n     2026-02-23T10:20:00.0000000\n\n [\"We've been seeing a massive increase in malicious usage of the Anitgravity backend that has tremendously degraded the quality of service for our users,\" said Google's Varun Mohan.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businesstoday.in%2Ftechnology%2Fnews%2Fstory%2Fgoogle%2Drestricts%2Dantigravity%2Dusers%2Dtied%2Dto%2Dsuspicious%2Dopenclaw%2Dbehaviour%2D517570%2D2026%2D02%2D23&rut=124af4d30256e5f335b6e32f1210b09ee53c18c93c3e45daf28b38d7e98ba22d)\n\n## [Google clamps down on Antigravity 'malicious usage', cutting off ...](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fventurebeat.com%2Forchestration%2Fgoogle%2Dclamps%2Ddown%2Don%2Dantigravity%2Dmalicious%2Dusage%2Dcutting%2Doff%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers&rut=49e7c6a497282f19c3679c9936a8b62090d5e6e3a7f5d85e3e074e6c16542dd5)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fventurebeat.com%2Forchestration%2Fgoogle%2Dclamps%2Ddown%2Don%2Dantigravity%2Dmalicious%2Dusage%2Dcutting%2Doff%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers&rut=49e7c6a497282f19c3679c9936a8b62090d5e6e3a7f5d85e3e074e6c16542dd5\n\n [venturebeat.com/orchestration/google-clamps-down-on-antigravity-malicious-usage-cutting-off-openclaw-users](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fventurebeat.com%2Forchestration%2Fgoogle%2Dclamps%2Ddown%2Don%2Dantigravity%2Dmalicious%2Dusage%2Dcutting%2Doff%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers&rut=49e7c6a497282f19c3679c9936a8b62090d5e6e3a7f5d85e3e074e6c16542dd5)\n\n     2026-02-23T00:00:00.0000000\n\n [Google DeepMind engineer and former CEO and founder of Windsurf, Varun Mohan, said in an X post that the company noticed \"malicious usage\" that led to service degradation.](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fventurebeat.com%2Forchestration%2Fgoogle%2Dclamps%2Ddown%2Don%2Dantigravity%2Dmalicious%2Dusage%2Dcutting%2Doff%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers&rut=49e7c6a497282f19c3679c9936a8b62090d5e6e3a7f5d85e3e074e6c16542dd5)\n\n## [Why is Google cracking down on OpenClaw users in antigravity?](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fhelloentrepreneurs.com%2Ftechnology%2Fwhy%2Dis%2Dgoogle%2Dcracking%2Ddown%2Don%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Din%2Dantigravity%2D78324%2F&rut=4fcde9fcc505acb66dd477b1189cc5287ef054529aa029bf50d8453c735da807)\n\n //duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2Fhelloentrepreneurs.com%2Ftechnology%2Fwhy%2Dis%2Dgoogle%2Dcracking%2Ddown%2Don%2Dopenclaw%2Dusers%2Din%2Dantigravity%2D78324%2F&rut=4fcde9fcc505acb66dd477b1189cc5287ef054529aa029bf50d8453c735da807\n\n [helloentrepreneurs.com/technology/why-is-google-cracking-down-on-openclaw-users-in-antigravity-78324/](//duckduckgo.com/l/?uddg=https%3A%2F%2\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"e3068ed24bb952e4\">>>"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1771935879839}}
